{"id":"db916f1fec757e0b","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-thm-determinacy.md","title":"Game Determinacy","display":"thm-determinacy — Game Determinacy","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-determinacy","aliases":["58-thm-determinacy","Gale-Stewart Theorem","Open Determinacy","Borel Determinacy"],"display":"thm-determinacy — Game Determinacy","depends_on":["[[../batch20/58-df-baire-space.md]]","[[58-df-game]]","[[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-determinacy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-determinacy</span><span>Gale-Stewart Theorem</span><span>Open Determinacy</span><span>Borel Determinacy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-determinacy — Game Determinacy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7e537464587f340f\" href=\"?note=7e537464587f340f\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-baire-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-baire-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2a48a890cd9aeba0\" href=\"?note=2a48a890cd9aeba0\" title=\"58-df-game\">58-df-game</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-borel.md\">../batch16/58-df-borel.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\\)</span> 为 payoff set</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_A\">\\(G_A\\)</span> 为双方交替选择自然数、生成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\omega^\\omega\">\\(x\\in\\omega^\\omega\\)</span> 且玩家 I 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in A\">\\(x\\in A\\)</span> 时获胜的博弈（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2a48a890cd9aeba0\" href=\"?note=2a48a890cd9aeba0\" title=\"58-df-game\">58-df-game</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathcal N}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathcal N}\\)</span> 为 Baire 空间 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega^\\omega\">\\(\\omega^\\omega\\)</span> 的通常拓扑，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Borel}(A,\\omega^\\omega,\\tau_{\\mathcal N})\">\\(\\mathrm{Borel}(A,\\omega^\\omega,\\tau_{\\mathcal N})\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-borel.md\">../batch16/58-df-borel.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_{\\mathrm I}\\coloneqq\\{s\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}:|\\operatorname{dom}(s)|\\text{ 为偶数}\\}\">\\(P_{\\mathrm I}\\coloneqq\\{s\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}:|\\operatorname{dom}(s)|\\text{ 为偶数}\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_{\\mathrm{II}}\\coloneqq\\{s\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}:|\\operatorname{dom}(s)|\\text{ 为奇数}\\}\">\\(P_{\\mathrm{II}}\\coloneqq\\{s\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}:|\\operatorname{dom}(s)|\\text{ 为奇数}\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> 是集合函数谓词（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists d_{\\mathcal N}\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcMetricBaireSpace}_S(\\omega^\\omega,\\tau_{\\mathcal N},d_{\\mathcal N})\">\\(\\exists d_{\\mathcal N}\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcMetricBaireSpace}_S(\\omega^\\omega,\\tau_{\\mathcal N},d_{\\mathcal N})\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"7e537464587f340f\" href=\"?note=7e537464587f340f\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-baire-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-baire-space.md</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}determinacy\\text{-}player\\text{-}positions}\\vdash\nP_{\\mathrm I}=\\{s\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}:\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;(\\operatorname{dom}(s)=2n)\\}\n\\land\nP_{\\mathrm{II}}=\\{s\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}:\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;(\\operatorname{dom}(s)=2n+1)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}determinacy\\text{-}player\\text{-}positions}\\vdash\nP_{\\mathrm I}=\\{s\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}:\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;(\\operatorname{dom}(s)=2n)\\}\n\\land\nP_{\\mathrm{II}}=\\{s\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}:\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;(\\operatorname{dom}(s)=2n+1)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}determinacy} \\vdash \\mathrm{Borel}(A,\\omega^\\omega,\\tau_{\\mathcal N})\\to\\left(\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\exists\\sigma\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\sigma,P_{\\mathrm I},\\omega)\\land\n\\forall x\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(x(2n)=\\sigma(x\\upharpoonright 2n))\\to x\\in A\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists\\tau\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\tau,P_{\\mathrm{II}},\\omega)\\land\n\\forall x\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(x(2n+1)=\\tau(x\\upharpoonright(2n+1)))\\to x\\notin A\\bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}determinacy} \\vdash \\mathrm{Borel}(A,\\omega^\\omega,\\tau_{\\mathcal N})\\to\\left(\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\exists\\sigma\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\sigma,P_{\\mathrm I},\\omega)\\land\n\\forall x\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(x(2n)=\\sigma(x\\upharpoonright 2n))\\to x\\in A\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists\\tau\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\tau,P_{\\mathrm{II}},\\omega)\\land\n\\forall x\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(x(2n+1)=\\tau(x\\upharpoonright(2n+1)))\\to x\\notin A\\bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Gale and Stewart (1953): open/closed determinacy.</li>\n<li>Martin (1975): Borel determinacy in ZFC.</li>\n<li>结论已展开为玩家 I 或玩家 II 的集合编码必胜策略，不再依赖无定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Det}\">\\(\\mathrm{Det}\\)</span> 谓词。</li>\n<li>Open and closed payoff games are already determined by the Gale-Stewart theorem.</li>\n<li>解析决定性不再是 ZFC 的定理，并具有非平凡的大基数或 sharp 一致性强度。</li>\n<li>There are arbitrary payoff sets <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A \\subseteq \\omega^\\omega\">\\(A \\subseteq \\omega^\\omega\\)</span> for which <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_A\">\\(G_A\\)</span> is not determined.</li>\n<li>AD (Axiom of Determinacy): all games determined. Contradicts AC.</li>\n<li>AD implies: all sets of reals are Lebesgue measurable, have Baire property, perfect set property.</li>\n<li>Projective determinacy: requires stronger large cardinals (Woodin).</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch20/58-df-baire-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"7e537464587f340f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-baire-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-game","status":"resolved","id":"2a48a890cd9aeba0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-game]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-borel.md","status":"r